Good nutrition keeps us healthy. Fish, eggs and beans give us protein. Rice and bread are carbohydrates that give us energy. Milk and cheese are dairy foods. Fruit and vegetables give us fibre. Minerals like calcium make our bones strong. We should eat only a small portion of sugar.

